title: "ProteoTrace: proteomics-only sample-consistency QC for longitudinal cohorts"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yuliantoro"
    given-names: "Herbi"
    email: "hey325@lehigh.edu"
    affiliation: "Lehigh University"
version: 0.3.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/herbiyuliantoro/proteotrace"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - quality control
  - sample consistency
  - longitudinal cohorts
  - batch correction
abstract: >-
  ProteoTrace screens longitudinal mass-spectrometry cohorts for protein
  abundance profiles that are inconsistent with their assigned donors. It
  does not require genotype data.
